  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.1', 'Urbanisation & Urban Change', 'What are the benefits of urbanisation?', 'Better access to jobs, education and healthcare, and economic growth.', 28),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.1', 'Urbanisation & Urban Change', 'What is an urban transport problem?', 'Traffic congestion, which causes pollution and delays.', 29),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '2.1', 'Urbanisation & Urban Change', 'How can urban transport problems be reduced?', 'Park-and-ride, congestion charges, bus lanes, cycle lanes and trams.', 30),
