  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.1', 'Tectonic Hazards', 'Why do people live near volcanoes?', 'Fertile soils, tourism, geothermal energy and minerals.', 19),
  ('Geography', 'Eduqas', 'gcse', '3.1', 'Tectonic Hazards', 'How can the effects of earthquakes be reduced?', 'Earthquake-proof buildings, education, emergency plans, and early warning systems.', 20),
